        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mahjong TPS. It's a mahjong game with unusual rules that use guns and bats.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a substitute player at high-stakes apartment mahjong. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run around the table to collect tiles and defeat your rivals. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■What are the rules?</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's mahjong. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You win if you collect more points than your opponent by the last round,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > or if you defeat all your opponents. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431340/extras/e0445dfa073268ff06f2918a09e721cc.avif?t=1783302620\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431340/extras_big/e0445dfa073268ff06f2918a09e721cc.avif?t=1783302620 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■Safe?</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the Mahjong Table - Battlefield, your mahjong power is tripled, and otherwise it is 1/3. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's safe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■Game of luck?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You can make a difference by stacking your hand or stacking your deck. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game starts before you draw. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431340/extras/8e8c2b0b181d29090dad9d805c981537.avif?t=1783302620\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431340/extras_big/8e8c2b0b181d29090dad9d805c981537.avif?t=1783302620 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■Goblin?</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throwing away tiles is a basic mahjong action called 'dahai',</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > but you are summoned as a result. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■Ikeda from the Home Mahjong Club?</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is the main character. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She challenges high-stakes apartment mahjong to solve the injustice of society with money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431340/extras/733fc339bf745232ebd5bc419cef4ce4.avif?t=1783302620\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431340/extras_big/733fc339bf745232ebd5bc419cef4ce4.avif?t=1783302620 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431340/extras/2040a3b7a9110c553c5c755db47eadc4.avif?t=1783302620\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431340/extras_big/2040a3b7a9110c553c5c755db47eadc4.avif?t=1783302620 width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
